OL,3,GNEWSAYouth club opens in memory of
OL,4,AHarvey Willgoose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of murdered schoolboy Harvey
OL,7,FWillgoose hopes a newly opened youth
OL,8,Fclub in his memory will be the first of
OL,9,Fmany in Sheffield.
OL,11,F'Harvey's Hub' has been set up at The
OL,12,FSpires Centre in Arbourthorne, just
OL,13,Fover a mile away from where Harvey, 15,
OL,14,Fwas fatally stabbed at All Saints
OL,15,FCatholic High School in February 2025.
OL,17,FThe youth facility is the first
OL,18,Fpermanent hub after a temporary club
OL,19,Fwas set up at Beighton Miners Club in
OL,20,FMay 2025.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
